- Creates int array a of same length.
- Parses each string to int.
- If a[0] == 0, prints "YES" and returns.
- Then loops ta from 0 to a[1]-1 (exclusive). For each ta, computes tmp = a[2] - (ta * a[4]). If tmp == a[0], prints YES and returns.
